G-SEO Framework Notice

This repository preserves historical structural and conceptual materials related to the legacy G-SEO Framework and its historical relationship to the Structural Evaluation Layer (SEL).

Certain naming conventions, structural definitions, and framework terms are preserved as part of the historical record of the G-SEO Framework and should not be interpreted as describing the current G-SEO specification.

The current G-SEO specification is maintained at https://g-seo.ai/g-seo-specification/

